He looked genuine, so I told him, "I own a pizza chain in Seattle and we'll be expanding. You always said I couldn't do it. I did it, Nick. I really did it."

INT. ROOM - DAY

NARRATOR
"Wow, man. I can't— I can't believe it. President Olson. That's fucking amazing. I am so proud of you, man. I love you."

INT. ROOM - DAY

NARRATOR
Right then, the guard from his side told him time was up. He smiled at me. "Bye." He spoke his last word to me, and that was it.

INT. ROOM - DAY

NARRATOR
